# `dayofweek` is the timespan since Sunday (as in KQL).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project sun = dayofweek(datetime(2024-03-03)), thu = dayofweek(datetime(2024-02-29T23:00:00Z)), sat = dayofweek(datetime(1969-12-27))
---- expected
sun      | thu        | sat
timespan | timespan   | timespan
---------+------------+-----------
00:00:00 | 4.00:00:00 | 6.00:00:00
